<title>USA: Circuit City sees Q3 EPS about $0.20.</title>
<headline>Circuit City sees Q3 EPS about $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Circuit City Stores Inc said Thursday it expects third quarter earnings of about $0.20 per share, citing continuing weak industry sales.</p>
</text>
